ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Brutalism
Board: /styles/brutalism
Companions: brutalism-starter.html, brutalism-study.ai, brutalism-study.psd

Document
3000 × 2000 px. Surround #d8d2c8.

Layer stack
- Stamp, mono, uppercase
- Word RAW
- Joint rule, 8 px, black
- Board-mark stripes (a pattern, not a photo of concrete)
- Slab
- Hard offset, 14 px black, behind the slab
- Surround

No gaussian noise pretending to be weathering. The marks come from the form, so draw them as stripes.
No pasted building photograph.
